  "instructions": [
    "Warm each tortilla in a dry skillet for 20 seconds on each side.",
    "Toast the cashews in a dry pan until fragrant, about 3 minutes.",
    "Slice the avocado and bell pepper, and squeeze lime juice over the avocado.",
    "Spread avocado on the tortilla and top with spinach, bell pepper, and a pinch of salt and pepper.",
    "Sprinkle toasted cashews over the greens and drizzle olive oil.",
    "Fold the sides of the tortilla in and roll tightly into a wrap.",
    "Slice the wrap in half and serve immediately.",
    "Optionally add extra lime wedges on the side.",
